  "description": "学习通（chaoxing）课程自动化浏览器扩展：视频/音频播放、PPT 翻页、AI 答题、验证码识别、讨论任务点",
  "license": "GPL-3.0",
  "scripts": {
    "check": "node tools/check.js",
    "concat": "node tools/concat-page.js",
